26	// matters: an unfiltered pass over this model is 1224 tensors a layer-stack
27	// and tens of gigabytes. Quantised nodes are skipped (they are weights, which
28	// the Go side reads from the GGUF itself).
29	//
30	// One file per *write*, named `NNNN_name.bin` with '/' -> '%'. The sequence
31	// number matters: `build_hc_mix` runs twice a layer, so `hc_norm-3` is two
32	// different tensors in one pass, and a name alone would have the second
