12	// this block is a no-op: the reference asks for `top_k + ratio - 1` = 2051
13	// cells out of a 256-cell cache, so it names every one of them and running
14	// the attention with the selection is bit-identical to running it without
15	// (TestAttnTopKCannotBiteHere). A second dump at 4096 tokens in a 4096-cell
16	// cache is where the width finally binds — 2051 of 4096 — and where the two
17	// questions L2e left open can be asked at all: what the selection *is*, and
18	// whether ours is the reference's.
19	//
20	// The fixture is a second trace directory rather than a replacement, because
21	// the 7-token one is still the only place a great many things are legible:
22	// the empty blocks that pool cell zero, the spare block, the f32 vector path
23	// that L3a-5 found the reference takes below 8 output columns. The two are
24	// complementary and both are kept.
